{"problem_id": "211538", "review_scope": "content", "status": "confirmed", "difficulty_level": "H2", "original_difficulty_level": "H3", "difficulty_reason": "在无理旋转遍历性、沿连分数渐近分母的Denjoy–Koksma界、L2平移连续性作为明确先修时，本证明通过单位相位归一化和q_n次迭代取得相位积分趋1，再由非零绕数导致的相位导数下界及分部积分取得O(q_n^{-1})，形成矛盾。这是有实质内容的博士专题分析证明，本轮判为H2；原H3理由仅依据研究论文与100行证明长度，不足以支持H3。", "evidence": [{"path": "editable-corpus/items/211538_author_proof.tex", "lines": [50, 59], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211538_author_proof.tex", "lines": [62, 112], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211538_author_proof.tex", "lines": [117, 159], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211538/source0.tex", "lines": [1067, 1076], "role": "source_primary_statement"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211538/source0.tex", "lines": [1078, 1177], "role": "source_primary_proof"}, {"path": "curation/revisions/211538-r001/changes.json", "role": "exact_source_context_repair"}, {"path": "curation/revisions/211538-r001/gate-result.json", "role": "fresh_item_gate"}, {"path": "curation/visual-review-211538.json", "role": "all_final_pages_viewed"}], "issue": "missing_author_context_repaired_in_local_revision", "review_stage": "local_revision_validated", "source_commit": "5c133eb3cb70ada8bd3ca187089fe69378e5bc52", "reviewed_statement_and_proof": true, "bundled_source_span_match": true, "independent_second_review_completed": false, "proposed_difficulty_level": "H3", "reviewer": "root", "reviewed_revision": "211538-r001", "original_review": {"problem_id": "211538", "review_scope": "content", "status": "needs_review", "difficulty_level": null, "original_difficulty_level": "H3", "difficulty_reason": "先用无理旋转的遍历性排除传递函数零集，再以连续分数回归把乘法上同调方程转为 L2 相位趋于一。若绕数非零，Denjoy–Koksma 控制相位导数，分部积分却使同一振荡积分趋于零，从而矛盾。需明确连续分数分母与 Denjoy–Koksma 的可引用先修范围，并独立判断该组合的剩余困难是否达到 H3。", "evidence": [{"path": "editable-corpus/items/211538_author_pr