{"problem_id": "211543", "review_scope": "content", "status": "needs_review", "difficulty_level": null, "original_difficulty_level": "H3", "difficulty_reason": "证明的实质是弱收敛测度下重心的连续性：利用非原子性给边界邻域统一质量界，以 Busemann 能量发散排除极小点逃向边界，再由局部一致收敛和唯一极小点识别极限。此机制比长度信息具体，但在存在唯一性已作先修后，仍需判断剩余紧性论证是否超过目标门槛。须补明 E_B、可容许测度及其能量定义，不因221行直接保留H3。", "evidence": [{"path": "editable-corpus/items/211543_author_proof.tex", "lines": [43, 59], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211543_author_proof.tex", "lines": [99, 193], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211543_author_proof.tex", "lines": [195, 279], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211543/source0.tex", "lines": [1335, 1342], "role": "source_primary_statement"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211543/source0.tex", "lines": [1344, 1564], "role": "source_primary_proof"}], "issue": "compactness_argument_requires_difficulty_calibration", "review_stage": "difficulty_reassessment", "source_commit": "5c133eb3cb70ada8bd3ca187089fe69378e5bc52", "reviewed_statement_and_proof": true, "bundled_source_span_match": true, "independent_second_review_completed": false}
