{"problem_id": "211551", "review_scope": "content", "status": "needs_review", "difficulty_level": null, "original_difficulty_level": "H3", "difficulty_reason": "以一次 Dirichlet 分割和 min-max 交错把内部本征值偏移转为外部谱计数问题，再用 Airy 尺度给出外部本征值的增长界。关键剩余步骤是证明能量窗中足够多的分割本征值属于内部谱，并将计数误差转为对 t 一致的 h^(3delta/2) 误差。须核清奇异半直线算子的定义、自伴边界条件、nu 范围与 Airy 渐近作为先修的范围，H3结论待第二审。", "evidence": [{"path": "editable-corpus/items/211551_author_proof.tex", "lines": [54, 65], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211551_author_proof.tex", "lines": [73, 136], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211551_author_proof.tex", "lines": [141, 229], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211551/source0.tex", "lines": [3423, 3434], "role": "source_primary_statement"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211551/source0.tex", "lines": [3436, 3599], "role": "source_primary_proof"}], "issue": "spectral_operator_context_and_second_review", "review_stage": "needs_second_review", "source_commit": "5c133eb3cb70ada8bd3ca187089fe69378e5bc52", "reviewed_statement_and_proof": true, "bundled_source_span_match": true, "independent_second_review_completed": false, "proposed_difficulty_level": "H3"}
