{"problem_id": "211577", "review_scope": "content", "status": "needs_review", "difficulty_level": null, "original_difficulty_level": "H3", "difficulty_reason": "通过外域势的Green核收缩建立迭代估计，以校正伴随解作外域权重，将有限迭代推进到 L1 算子范数收敛。随后分别控制边界通量、非线性源项和几何profile误差，使极限余项满足题面尺度界。这里的加权核对称性、极限交换与多类误差兼容构成具体审查对象；全局Green、无Dirac质量及校正伴随引理目前只列声明，需核对核心依赖与维数范围再作H3第二审。", "evidence": [{"path": "editable-corpus/items/211577_author_proof.tex", "lines": [182, 198], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211577_author_proof.tex", "lines": [200, 268], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211577_author_proof.tex", "lines": [290, 493], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211577_author_proof.tex", "lines": [495, 646], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211577/source0.tex", "lines": [1864, 1880], "role": "source_primary_statement"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211577/source0.tex", "lines": [1882, 2329], "role": "source_primary_proof"}], "issue": "weighted_green_core_dependencies_need_review", "review_stage": "needs_second_review", "source_commit": "5c133eb3cb70ada8bd3ca187089fe69378e5bc52", "reviewed_statement_and_proof": true, "bundled_source_span_match": true, "independent_second_review_completed": false, "proposed_difficulty_level": "H3"}
{"problem_id": "211585", "review_scope": "content", "status": "needs_review", "difficulty_level": null, "original_difficulty_level": "H3", "difficulty_reason": "作者把各Sylow子群的稳定子条件化为等型分量上的张量展平秩条件，再通过各变量次数小于有限域大小的行列式乘积同步满足所有平移约束。过大张量因子情形需另作保列空间参数化，并用秩一系数控制行列式次数；这才是本题特定的剩余机制。须明确有限底域及张量分解假设，核清从不可约模到各矩阵代数的步骤，并独立第二审H3。", "evidence": [{"path": "editable-corpus/items/211585_author_proof.tex", "lines": [43, 51], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211585_author_proof.tex", "lines": [55, 106], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211585_author_proof.tex", "lines": [109, 165], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211585/source0.tex", "lines": [262, 271], "role": "source_primary_statement"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211585/source0.tex", "lines": [286, 398], "role": "source_primary_proof"}], "issue": "finite_field_and_tensor_decomposition_assumptions_review", "review_stage": "needs_second_review", "source_commit": "5c133eb3cb70ada8bd3ca187089fe69378e5bc52", "reviewed_statement_and_proof": true, "bundled_source_span_match": true, "independent_second_review_completed": false, "proposed_difficulty_level": "H3"}
{"problem_id": "211589", "review_scope": "content", "status": "needs_review", "difficulty_level": null, "original_difficulty_level": "H3", "difficulty_reason": "证明把Hartree势作齐次频率分解，并在低频因子上进一步作立方体分块，用有限邻接关系把求和保留在范数内。高低频双线性增益、U_Delta^2平方和控制和核尺度相乘后产生可求和的2^(k/2)因子，得到所需的(M/N)^(1/2)增益。须核明函数空间与频率投影定义，并判定所引用双线性及平方和引理作为先修后的剩余难度；H3仅列为二审建议。", "evidence": [{"path": "editable-corpus/items/211589_author_proof.tex", "lines": [40, 65], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211589_author_proof.tex", "lines": [68, 123], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211589_author_proof.tex", "lines": [124, 171], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211589/source0.tex", "lines": [920, 924], "role": "source_primary_statement"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211589/source0.tex", "lines": [964, 1070], "role": "source_primary_proof"}], "issue": "bilinear_prerequisites_and_remaining_difficulty_review", "review_stage": "needs_second_review", "source_commit": "5c133eb3cb70ada8bd3ca187089fe69378e5bc52", "reviewed_statement_and_proof": true, "bundled_source_span_match": true, "independent_second_review_completed": false, "proposed_difficulty_level": "H3"}
{"problem_id": "211603", "review_scope": "content", "status": "needs_review", "difficulty_level": null, "original_difficulty_level": "H3", "difficulty_reason": "作者先构造带交叉项的Lyapunov函数控制矩，再对相对Fisher信息与熵组合推导退化噪声下的耗散。关键在将冻结温度的低温LSI耗散与变化温度误差统一成比较微分不等式，结合Gibbs尾界得到显式退火概率速率。矩阵耗散证书和初始密度逼近是重要依赖，现交付只保留其声明且若干系数与泛函定义未展开；需核清这些依赖并独立第二审H3。", "evidence": [{"path": "editable-corpus/items/211603_author_proof.tex", "lines": [183, 193], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211603_author_proof.tex", "lines": [198, 287], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211603_author_proof.tex", "lines": [290, 375], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211603_author_proof.tex", "lines": [378, 493], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211603/source0.tex", "lines": [1116, 1126], "role": "source_primary_statement"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211603/source0.tex", "lines": [1143, 1442], "role": "source_primary_proof"}], "issue": "hypocoercive_dissipation_context_and_second_review", "review_stage": "needs_second_review", "source_commit": "5c133eb3cb70ada8bd3ca187089fe69378e5bc52", "reviewed_statement_and_proof": true, "bundled_source_span_match": true, "independent_second_review_completed": false, "proposed_difficulty_level": "H3"}
{"problem_id": "211627", "review_scope": "content", "status": "hold", "difficulty_level": null, "original_difficulty_level": "H3", "difficulty_reason": "该证明的目标是离散速度、压力和温度的耦合稳定性，主要通过能量恒等式、非线性估计与离散比较引理完成。原文三维部分却写 (1-k)/k 大于一个正数，并据此声称 k>4；当 k>4 时左端为负，与所列条件矛盾。该符号问题保留原样并暂停资格判断；还需核对从一般 k 到 k=5 的特化及局部时间范围，不能由本次编辑代作者修补数学证明。", "evidence": [{"path": "editable-corpus/items/211627_author_proof.tex", "lines": [103, 110], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211627_author_proof.tex", "lines": [187, 200], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/211627_author_proof.tex", "lines": [283, 320], "role": "reviewed_mathematical_mechanism_or_issue"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211627/source0.tex", "lines": [343, 350], "role": "source_primary_statement"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/211627/source0.tex", "lines": [351, 560], "role": "source_primary_proof"}], "issue": "source_internal_sign_inconsistency", "review_stage": "repair_required", "source_commit": "5c133eb3cb70ada8bd3ca187089fe69378e5bc52", "reviewed_statement_and_proof": true, "bundled_source_span_match": true, "independent_second_review_completed": false}
{"problem_id": "001", "review_scope": "content", "status": "needs_review", "difficulty_level": null, "original_difficulty_level": "H2", "difficulty_reason": "该旧题的保留证明从理想层H1消失构造穿过任意闭点的仿射主开邻域，再取有限覆盖并对核层作理想层商的过滤，推出全局函数生成单位理想。这给出了与本题一一对应的两段机制，且作者正文中可逐段定位，可作为难度理由的正面对照。本轮未以此将旧H2晋升为目标H3；标准先修为准凝聚理想层、长正合序列与主开仿射判据，若进入H3视图仍需按同一门槛第二审。", "evidence": [{"path": "editable-corpus/items/001_stacks_01XF.tex", "lines": [105, 146], "role": "statement_and_global_section_construction"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/items/001_stacks_01XF.tex", "lines": [149, 205], "role": "finite_cover_and_filtration_argument"}, {"path": "editable-corpus/sources/001/primary.excerpt.tex", "lines": [1, 101], "role": "retained_author_source"}], "issue": "positive_specific_reason_control_not_H3_admission", "review_stage": "positive_control_pending_target_calibration", "positive_comparison": true, "source_commit": "5c133eb3cb70ada8bd3ca187089fe69378e5bc52"}
